# Phenom competitor job lifecycle sequence diagrams

## Workday
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Recruiter
    participant R as Requisition
    participant P as Posting
    U->>R: Create draft requisition
    U->>R: Submit for approval
    R-->>U: Approved / open
    U->>P: Create internal or external posting
    U->>P: Set posting start and end dates
    P-->>U: Published / live
    U->>P: Freeze, unpost, or resume
    P-->>U: Unpublished or republished
    U->>R: Fill openings or close requisition
    R-->>P: Close removes eligibility for posting
    R-->>U: Closed
```

## SAP SuccessFactors
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Recruiter
    participant R as Requisition
    participant P as Posting
    U->>R: Create pre-approved requisition
    U->>R: Route for approval
    R-->>U: Approved / open
    U->>P: Choose internal or external posting
    U->>P: Set posting start and end dates
    P-->>U: Posted / live
    alt End date reached
        P-->>U: Expired / removed
    else User removes post
        U->>P: Remove post
        P-->>U: Unposted
    end
    U->>R: Fill openings or close
    R-->>U: Closed or reopened
```

## Greenhouse
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Recruiter
    participant J as Job
    participant O as Opening
    participant P as Job post
    U->>J: Create draft job and openings
    U->>J: Submit for approval
    J-->>U: Open
    U->>P: Create and configure job post
    U->>P: Publish to channel
    P-->>U: Live
    U->>P: Edit or unpublish
    P-->>U: Paused / unpublished
    U->>O: Fill or close openings
    U->>J: Close job
    J-->>P: Unpublish active posts
    J-->>U: Closed or reopened
```

## Ashby
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Recruiter
    participant J as Job
    participant O as Opening
    participant P as Posting
    U->>J: Create job draft and openings
    U->>J: Complete approval if configured
    J-->>U: Open
    U->>P: Create posting
    U->>P: Set visibility and deadline
    U->>P: Publish
    alt Listed
        P-->>U: Discoverable and live
    else Unlisted
        P-->>U: Hidden from lists; direct link can apply
    end
    alt Deadline reached
        P-->>U: Automatically unpublished / expired
    else User unpublishes
        U->>P: Unpublish
        P-->>U: No new applications
    end
    U->>O: Fill openings
    U->>J: Close job
    J-->>P: Remove postings
```

## Workable
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Recruiter
    participant R as Requisition
    participant J as Job
    participant C as Channel
    U->>R: Create draft requisition
    U->>R: Submit and obtain approval
    R-->>U: Open
    U->>J: Configure job visibility
    U->>C: Distribute to career page or boards
    C-->>U: In review or published
    alt Hold or unpublish
        U->>J: Set internal or on hold
        J-->>C: Remove public visibility
    else Channel promotion ends
        C-->>U: Promotion/board expiry
    end
    U->>R: Reserve, fill, cancel, or archive
    R-->>U: Archived / unarchive possible
```

## Personio
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Recruiter
    participant J as Job
    participant P as Promotion
    participant C as Job board
    U->>J: Create draft job
    U->>J: Publish to career page
    J-->>U: Published
    U->>P: Select external channels
    U->>P: Set start and end dates
    P-->>C: Scheduled
    C-->>P: Running / live
    alt End date reached
        C-->>P: Expired
    else User stops promotion
        U->>P: Cancel or remove promotion
        P-->>C: Stopped / canceled
    end
    U->>J: Fill opening and archive
    J-->>U: Archived
    U->>J: Reopen
    J-->>U: Draft
```
